journey
  %% Journey: a checkout walked step by step; the payment step is where it dips
  title Checkout
  section Shop
    Browse: 5: Customer
    Add to cart: 4: Customer
  section Pay
    Enter card: 2: Customer
    Confirm: 4: Customer

animate
  build
  step "Entering the card is where it hurts"
    focus "Enter card"
    mark "Enter card" fail
    with badge "Enter card" "drop-off" as fail
